---
layout: base.njk
---
<div class="home-shell">
  <section class="home-intro" aria-labelledby="home-title" data-reveal>
    <div class="intro-status"><span aria-hidden="true"></span><span>LEARNING LOG · ULSAN</span><time datetime="2026">2026</time></div>
    <div class="intro-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="section-label">A CURIOUS LEARNING ARCHIVE</p>
        <h1 id="home-title">안녕하세요,<br><strong>somani</strong>입니다.</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="intro-copy">
        <p>다양한 분야에 호기심을 가지고 공부하며, 새롭게 배운 내용과 직접 경험한 것들을 기록하는 공간입니다.</p>
        <ul aria-label="관심 분야"><li>Development</li><li>Security</li><li>AI</li><li>Data</li></ul>
        <div class="intro-links"><a href="/archive/">최근 기록 보기 <span>↗</span></a><a href="/about/">somani 소개 <span>→</span></a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="home-dashboard">
    <section class="archive-index" aria-labelledby="archive-index-title" data-category-index data-reveal>
      <header class="section-heading compact-heading">
        <div><p class="section-label">ARCHIVE INDEX</p><h2 id="archive-index-title">어떤 기록을 찾고 있나요?</h2></div>
        <p>카테고리를 선택하면 설명과 최신 기록을 미리 볼 수 있어요.</p>
      </header>
      <div class="index-layout">
        <ol class="category-index-list">
          {% for category in topics %}{% set categoryPosts = collections.posts | inCategory(category.name) %}
          <li{% if loop.first %} class="is-active"{% endif %}>
            <a href="/categories/{{ category.slug }}/" data-category-trigger data-preview-id="category-preview-{{ loop.index }}"{% if loop.first %} data-active="true"{% endif %}>
              <span class="category-number">0{{ loop.index }}</span>
              <span class="category-title"><strong>{{ category.name }}</strong><small>{{ category.label }}</small></span>
              <span class="category-count">{{ categoryPosts | length }}</span><span class="category-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
              <span class="category-mobile-detail">{{ category.description }}{% for post in categoryPosts | take(1) %}<br>최근 기록 · {{ post.data.title }}{% endfor %}</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ol>
        <div class="category-preview" aria-live="polite">
          {% for category in topics %}{% set categoryPosts = collections.posts | inCategory(category.name) %}
          <section id="category-preview-{{ loop.index }}" data-category-panel{% if not loop.first %} hidden{% endif %}>
            <div class="preview-meta"><span>0{{ loop.index }} · {{ category.label }}</span><span>{{ categoryPosts | length }} NOTES</span></div>
            <h3>{{ category.name }}</h3><p>{{ category.description }}</p>
            {% for post in categoryPosts | take(1) %}<div class="preview-latest"><span>RECENT · {{ post.date | dateISO }}</span><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }} <span>↗</span></a></div>{% else %}<div class="preview-empty"><span>RECENT</span><p>첫 기록을 준비하고 있습니다.</p></div>{% endfor %}
            <a class="preview-open" href="/categories/{{ category.slug }}/">이 카테고리 둘러보기 <span>→</span></a>
          </section>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="personal-workspace" aria-labelledby="workspace-title" data-reveal>
      <header class="workspace-heading"><div><p class="section-label">PERSONAL WORKSPACE</p><h2 id="workspace-title">somani's workspace</h2></div><span class="workspace-status"><i></i>OPEN</span></header>
      <div class="workspace-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="워크스페이스 보기" data-tablist>
        <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="profile-panel" id="profile-tab">Profile</button>
        <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="latest-panel" id="latest-tab" tabindex="-1">Latest</button>
        <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="project-panel" id="project-tab" tabindex="-1">Project</button>
      </div>
      <div class="workspace-panels">
        <article class="workspace-panel profile-panel is-active" id="profile-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="profile-tab" data-tab-panel>
          <div class="profile-image-wrap"><img src="{{ profile.image }}" alt="{{ profile.imageAlt }}" width="736" height="781"><span aria-hidden="true">hello!</span></div>
          <div class="profile-summary"><p class="panel-kicker">{{ profile.name }} · ICT융합학부</p><h3>Hello, I'm somani.</h3><p>안녕하세요, somani입니다.<br>궁금한 것을 배우고 경험하며 기록해요.</p><ul>{% for interest in profile.primaryInterests | take(4) %}<li>{{ interest }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul><a href="/about/">프로필 더 보기 <span>→</span></a></div>
        </article>
        {% for post in collections.posts | take(1) %}
        <article class="workspace-panel latest-panel" id="latest-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="latest-tab" data-tab-panel aria-hidden="true" inert>
          <div class="panel-kicker-row"><p class="panel-kicker">LATEST NOTE</p><time datetime="{{ post.date | dateISO }}">{{ post.date | dateISO }}</time></div><span class="note-category">{{ post.data.categories[0] }}</span><h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3><p>{{ post.data.description }}</p><div class="panel-tags">{% for tag in post.data.tags %}<span>#{{ tag }}</span>{% endfor %}</div><a href="{{ post.url }}">기록 읽기 <span>↗</span></a>
        </article>
        {% endfor %}
        {% for project in projects | take(1) %}
        <article class="workspace-panel project-panel" id="project-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="project-tab" data-tab-panel aria-hidden="true" inert>
          <div class="panel-kicker-row"><p class="panel-kicker">SELECTED PROJECT</p><span>01</span></div><h3>{{ project.name }}</h3><p>{{ project.description }}</p><ul class="project-stack">{% for technology in project.stack %}<li>{{ technology }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul><div class="project-links"><a href="{{ project.post }}">구축 기록 <span>→</span></a><a href="{{ project.repository }}">GitHub <span>↗</span></a></div>
        </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <p class="workspace-help">탭을 클릭하거나 좌우 방향키로 전환할 수 있어요.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
